      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاشَ لِلّٰهِ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنْزِيهًا لِلّٰهِ</span>. One should not say
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاشَ لَكَ</span>, but <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاشَاكَ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاشَى لَكَ</span>. (S, K.)
[See these phrases explained in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حشى</span>.]

